{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794558722396,"sessionID":"ses_e2bf95611ffeMCh1HsPk0i36oT","part":{"partID":"prt_1d408ea870020wYSCT0ACMaJSx","sessionID":"ses_e2bf95611ffeMCh1HsPk0i36oT","messageID":"msg_1d408da2e001vVVGnX2oXt6wF1","type":"tool","id":"chatcmpl-tool-a1560469f46c8a95","tool":"edit","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"newString":"A runtime name outside claude, opencode, codex, cursor, devin and pi or the ones already there, a shape outside the three, or an instruction word outside the two is not guessed. Ask that one question again with the accepted values. When the engine refuses a root, show its `ERROR:` line as it printed and ask question 1 again.\n\nDSH is not offered, because the link manifest has no DSH row.","oldString":"A runtime name outside the seven, a shape outside the three, or an instruction word outside the two is not guessed. Ask that one question again with the accepted values. When the engine refuses a root, show its `ERROR:` line as it printed and ask question 1 again.","path":"/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/.skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-install-presentation.txt"},"output":"Edited .skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-install-presentation.txt (1 replacement)","title":"edit","metadata":{"metadata":{"files":[{"file":".skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-install-presentation.txt","patch":"Index: .skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-install-presentation.txt\n===================================================================\n--- .skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-install-presentation.txt\n+++ .skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-install-presentation.txt\n@@ -74,10 +74,12 @@\n | `merge` | `--mode merge` | A real folder whose children are links. A local file already in the folder is kept and reported, never overwritten |\n | `embed` | step 2 stays | The repo keeps its own `AGENTS.md` and the shipped sections are refreshed into it |\n | `link` | step 1 gains `--link-instructions`, step 2 is dropped | `AGENTS.md`, `CLAUDE.md` and `REPO RULES.md` become links into the checkout |\n \n-A runtime name outside the seven, a shape outside the three, or an instruction word outside the two is not guessed. Ask that one question again with the accepted values. When the engine refuses a root, show its `ERROR:` line as it printed and ask question 1 again.\n+A runtime name outside claude, opencode, codex, cursor, devin and pi or the ones already there, a shape outside the three, or an instruction word outside the two is not guessed. Ask that one question again with the accepted values. When the engine refuses a root, show its `ERROR:` line as it printed and ask question 1 again.\n \n+DSH is not offered, because the link manifest has no DSH row.\n+\n ## 5. The Symlink Check\n \n Run `node .skilled/commands/doctor/scripts/symlink-engine.cjs check --root <dir> [--runtimes <list>] [--link-instructions]` once, in place and read-only, then render its entry lines as they print:\n \n","status":"modified","additions":3,"deletions":1}],"truncated":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Edited .skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-install-presentation.txt (1 replacement)"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"newString\": \"A runtime name outside claude, opencode, codex, cursor, devin and pi or the ones already there, a shape outside the three, or an instruction word outside the two is not guessed. Ask that one question again with the accepted values. When the engine refuses a root, show its `ERROR:` line as it printed and ask question 1 again.\\n\\nDSH is not offered, because the link manifest has no DSH row.\", \"oldString\": \"A runtime name outside the seven, a shape outside the three, or an instruction word outside the two is not guessed. Ask that one question again with the accepted values. When the engine refuses a root, show its `ERROR:` line as it printed and ask question 1 again.\", \"path\": \"/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/.skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-install-presentation.txt\"}"},"time":{"start":1794558716551,"end":1794558722396}}}}
